{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"733827728972841061","content":"She sits at the edge. She takes a moment to look at here reflection before speaking.","created_at":"2020-08-21T21:53:22.264000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746487135921766470","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"733827728972841061","content":"\"Bae... Baeshra no believe in gods long time. No gods for Baeshra old tribe. Baeshra no know if this work. Baeshra still try. May be some one listen... May be only Baeshra hear Baeshra.\" Baeshra takes a deep breath and undoes her necklace. She stares at the werewolf fur pouch hanging from it. Thinking of all the trophies inside. Each one of them, from the fangs of werewolves and splinters from the living house in London, to the whiskers of the rust monster and the teeth of the decapus. From the mothman scales to a scrap of Hag's rags. Howler teeth and windigo claws. And even spare cogs from the robots, and a vial of strange blood from her trip to Hell. Every little trophy she's claimed. Every memory she's held since meeting Web. Baeshra lowers the necklace, the pouch and all its contents into the water. Baeshra takes a deep breath and begins to speak again. \"Baeshra say no believe in gods... long time. Baeshra believe now. Baeshra believe in small Melon, god of Leaf and Storm. Melon good fish god. Baeshra also believe in Web, Spider God. Baeshra ask other gods give help to Web, Spider God. Web much good. Baeshra no mean help in fight against hunger. Baeshra protect Web in fight. Baeshra ask help Web see they Spider God. Like... Anta Sea of old. No like Low Earth the mean... Puh... puhl.. Pl-ea-se.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T21:53:29.067000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-21T21:54:14.919000Z","id":"746487164455485522","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
